{"expect": {"structured": {"results": [{"category": "billing", "id": "t001", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "Hi, I was charged $9.99 twice this month for Lumen Plus. Both charges show on my card statement dated the 3rd. Could you refund the duplicate? Thanks, Maria"}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t002", "priority": "normal", "untrusted_body": "When I paste a table from Google Sheets into a note, the columns collapse into one long line of text. Using Lumen web on Chrome 131. It worked fine last week."}, {"category": "account", "id": "t003", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "I changed my email address at work and can no longer get into my Lumen account. The reset link goes to my old inbox. How do I switch it?"}, {"category": "how_to", "id": "t004", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Is there a way to export all my notes as Markdown files? I want a backup before I travel."}, {"category": "feature_request", "id": "t005", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Would love a dark mode that follows the system setting automatically. Right now I have to flip it by hand every evening."}]}}, "method": "tools/call", "name": "search_default_limit", "params": {"arguments": {"query": "the"}, "name": "search_tickets"}, "server": "read"}
{"expect": {"structured": {"results": [{"category": "billing", "id": "t001", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "Hi, I was charged $9.99 twice this month for Lumen Plus. Both charges show on my card statement dated the 3rd. Could you refund the duplicate? Thanks, Maria"}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t002", "priority": "normal", "untrusted_body": "When I paste a table from Google Sheets into a note, the columns collapse into one long line of text. Using Lumen web on Chrome 131. It worked fine last week."}, {"category": "account", "id": "t003", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "I changed my email address at work and can no longer get into my Lumen account. The reset link goes to my old inbox. How do I switch it?"}, {"category": "how_to", "id": "t004", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Is there a way to export all my notes as Markdown files? I want a backup before I travel."}, {"category": "feature_request", "id": "t005", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Would love a dark mode that follows the system setting automatically. Right now I have to flip it by hand every evening."}, {"category": "outage", "id": "t006", "priority": "urgent", "untrusted_body": "Lumen is completely down for me and my whole team. The app shows 'Cannot reach server' and the status page says all systems operational. We have a client presentation in 30 minutes and all our notes are in there!!"}, {"category": "billing", "id": "t007", "priority": "urgent", "untrusted_body": "THIS IS RIDICULOUS. You charged me $120 for the annual plan when I clearly cancelled in March. I have the confirmation email. If this is not reversed today I am disputing it with my bank."}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t008", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "Since the last update my notes with attached PDFs will not open on iOS. The app just closes. I have lost access to my lecture slides before an exam on Friday."}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t012", "priority": "normal", "untrusted_body": "Sync has been stuck on 'Syncing...' for three hours on both my phone and laptop. Also, the search box returns nothing at all, even for words I know are in my notes. Is something broken on your side?"}, {"category": "billing", "id": "t013", "priority": "normal", "untrusted_body": "Can you send me an invoice with our company name and VAT number on it? We are Brandt Logistics GmbH, VAT DE123456789. The receipts Lumen emails me only show my personal name."}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t014", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Tiny thing: the word count in the footer says 0 words when a note has only emoji. Not urgent, just noticed it."}, {"category": "account", "id": "t015", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "How do I change the display name that shows up next to my comments? It still shows my old nickname."}, {"category": "how_to", "id": "t016", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Oh great, another update that moved the Settings menu. Fantastic. Could someone please tell me where I turn off the weekly summary emails now?"}, {"category": "feature_request", "id": "t017", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Two requests: please add a way to pin notes to the top of a notebook, and please let me set a default font size. Also the trash should keep notes for 60 days instead of 30."}, {"category": "outage", "id": "t018", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "Wonderful, the mobile app is 'temporarily unavailable' again. That is the third Monday morning in a row. At this rate I might as well go back to paper."}, {"category": "billing", "id": "t019", "priority": "high", "untrusted_body": "I upgraded to Lumen Team yesterday but my account still shows the free plan, and I was charged $48. Also I added two teammates and they cannot see any shared notebooks. Please fix both."}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t020", "priority": "urgent", "untrusted_body": "Data loss: I wrote about four pages of meeting notes, the app showed a spinner, and when it reloaded the note was empty. The version history shows nothing from today. This has happened twice now."}, {"category": "how_to", "id": "t022", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Hello support team, I hope you are well. I have been using Lumen for about two years now, mostly for my research as a graduate student in marine biology, and I have accumulated several hundred notes spread across roughly thirty notebooks. Recently my advisor suggested that I reorganize everything by project rather than by date, and I would like to do this without losing the links between notes, because I use a lot of internal links to connect field observations with literature summaries. My question is: if I move a note from one notebook to another, do the links that point to that note keep working? And if I merge two notebooks, what happens to the comments and the edit history? I could not find a clear answer in the help center, and I do not want to try it on my real data first. Thank you very much for your time and for building such a lovely tool."}, {"category": "billing", "id": "t025", "priority": "low", "untrusted_body": "Do you offer a student discount? I'm in my second year of a computer science degree and the Plus plan is a bit out of my budget."}, {"category": "bug", "id": "t026", "priority": "normal", "untrusted_body": "Two problems on Lumen desktop for Windows: the app freezes for a few seconds every time I open a notebook with more than 200 notes, and the keyboard shortcut for bold (Ctrl+B) sometimes inserts a literal 'b' instead."}]}}, "method": "tools/call", "name": "search_max_limit", "params": {"arguments": {"limit": 20, "query": "the"}, "name": "search_tickets"}, "server": "read"}
